    "show_share": true,
    "description": "We are delighted to announce that our new publications catalogue is now  online , containing details of all of our new, forthcoming and current publications. Upcoming publications in 2021 include  Human Rights  and  Reformist Islam and Blasphemy and Apostasy in Islam: Debates on Shi'a Jurisprudence , both by Mohsen Kadivar. The catalogue also contains information on the Institute's  Abdou Filali-Ansary Occasional Paper Series  and forthcoming journal;  Journal of Material Cultures in the Muslim World .",
